sentences.text:
In Hardeep Singh (Supra), it has been eloquently held that the word evidence in Section 319 Cr.P.C. has to be broadly understood and thus materials which have come before the Court in course of enquiry can be used for : 
(i) corroboration of evidence recorded by Court after commencement of trial;
(ii) for exercise of power under Section 319 Cr.P.C.; and (2023) 1 SCC 289 Page | 7 (iii) also to add an accused whose name is shown in column no.2 of the chargesheet.
